        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1985] After receiving the ServiceSelectionReq, if there are already existing services, i.e. Internet_Service, ParkingStatus_Service, and/or ACDP_SystemStatus_Service as listed in Table 204 which have not been stopped earlier, these services shall be stopped.",
            "block_bbox": [
